{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-12-15 09:00:00', 'title': 'IBM HELPS FINANCIAL SERVICES INDUSTRY MANAGE RISK AND REGULATIONS WITH CSA', 'text': 'IBM FINANCIAL SERVICES CLOUD COUNCIL GROWS TO MORE THAN 120\xa0MEMBERS FROM 70+ BANKS TO\xa0HELP MITIGATE SYSTEMIC RISK IN THE INDUSTRY COUNCIL LEVERAGES COLLECTIVE INTELLIGENCE OF BNP PARIBAS, DISCOVER FINANCIAL SERVICES, BANCO SABADELL, BANCO BRADESCO, NATIONWIDE, VIRGIN MONEY\xa0AND MORE ARMONK, N.Y. , DEC. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, IBM (NYSE: IBM) ANNOUNCED IT IS WORKING WITH THE CLOUD SECURITY ALLIANCE -- A GLOBAL NOT-FOR-PROFIT DEDICATED TO DEFINING STANDARDS, CERTIFICATIONS, AND BEST PRACTICES TO HELP ENSURE SECURED CLOUD COMPUTING -- THAT AIMS TO FURTHER ADVANCE SECURITY AND RISK MANAGEMENT OF CLOUD WITHIN FINANCIAL SERVICES.'}